{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:0.1"], "en": "The Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:0.2", "PA_ja_171:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Virtuous (Kalyāṇavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:0.4"], "en": "1. The Kalyāṇadhamma Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:1.1", "PA_ja_171:1.2"], "en": "“When one attains the designation ‘one of virtuous nature’ in the world, O Lord of Men;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:1.3"], "en": "Therefore, a wise man should not be shamed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:1.4"], "en": "for even through shame, the virtuous take up their burden.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:2.1"], "en": "This very designation has now been reached here today.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:2.2"], "en": "“O Lord of Men, one is called ‘possessed of auspicious qualities’ in this world;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:2.3"], "en": "having considered this, I shall go forth here,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:2.4"], "en": "for I have no desire for these sensual pleasures.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_171:3.1"], "en": "The Kalyāṇadhamma Jātaka, the first.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
